            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p><strong>Removes peach fuzz and dead skin.</strong> Skin feels smoother and softer straight after use.</p><p><strong>Built-in LED light.</strong> Lights up the blade area so fine, pale hairs are easier to see.</p><p><strong>3 speeds.</strong> Gentle for beginners and sensitive skin, standard for regular use, and a stronger setting for areas like the T-zone.</p><p><strong>U-shaped blade, easy to swap.</strong> Comes with 5 spare blades so you can use a fresh one each session.</p><p><strong>Tidy brows too.</strong> Use the tip to clean up stray hairs around the brow line.</p>"
