        "tab_how": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How to use",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p>Tie your hair back. Cleanse your face and pat it completely dry. Make sure a clean blade is fitted, switch on and choose speed 1. Hold the skin taut and the tool at about a 45° angle, then make short, light strokes over the cheeks, jawline, chin and forehead. Avoid the eyelids, lips, spots and any irritated skin. Switch off, rinse the head, and apply a gentle moisturizer. Skip exfoliating acids and heavy makeup for the rest of the day.</p>"
